@@ -0,0 +1,282 @@
+/*
+ * Allwinner CPU Configuration Module emulation
+ *
+ * Copyright (C) 2019 Niek Linnenbank <nieklinnenbank@gmail.com>
+ *
+ * This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
